<title>HONG KONG: First Pacific sells property to director.</title>
<headline>First Pacific sells property to director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Pacific Co Ltd said on Friday it has agreed to sell a residential property on Hong Kong's outlying Lantau island to executive director David Davies for HK$12 million.</p>
<p>The property, a two-storey residential building with a gross floor area of 2,134 square feet on the south side of Lantau island, was sold at a price equal to the open market value, the company said.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale will be used for working capital, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
